  "summary": "With the recent shutdown of Quibi, I'm getting a lot of messages, so I apologize in advance if it takes a while to respond.\n\nPlease note, at this time, I'm only open to roles based in Beijing/Taipei/Los Angeles or remote (preferred).\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nEntrepreneurial engineer with 15+ years of programming experience. I am very experienced with the full development stack, from frontend to backend, on both web and mobile.\n\nSee the \"Featured\" section below for public consumer-facing applications I've shipped. I've also shipped applications for internal company use. If you worked at Google at the same time as me, chances are you've been impacted by my work.\n\nContact me regarding:\n\n- Projects that employ JavaScript/React/Redux/Node (I have expertise in shipping web projects using this stack).\n\n- Opportunities involving Greater China (I am professionally fluent in Mandarin Chinese at an HSK 5 level and travel there regularly).\n\n- Applications of deep learning/neural networks (disclosure: I haven't had a chance to use this in a professional capacity yet, but this is a personal interest of mine).\n\n- The health/longevity/biotech space (I'm interested in helping to advance this field).",
